<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the third day of four-day Supersport Series cricket matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>In Cape Town: Western Province 433-3 declared and 215-9 (Craig Matthews 64, Brian McMillan 63), Natal 359 (Derek Crookes 96, Neil Johnson 52).</p>
<p>In Bloemfontein: Free State 178 and 275 (Gerhardus Liebenberg 85, Tim Shaw 4-81), Eastern Province 198 and 174-7.</p>
<p>In Centurion: Transvaal 201-6 declared (Adam Bacher 102), Northern Transvaal 103-3 (Roy Pienaar 50 not out).</p>
